        chapters[5]['items'].append(item('Diarrhoea needs the correct response','Fluorouracil and pembrolizumab can both cause diarrhoea through different mechanisms. Contact the team early rather than assuming it is ordinary chemotherapy diarrhoea; use rescue medicine only under the written plan.','nccp'))
